1
00:00:00,026 --> 00:00:02,734
10 LAKH requests! Aur mera server… gaya!

2
00:00:03,076 --> 00:00:07,316
Toh maine banaya SERVER SIEGE — ek playable 3D system-design simulator!

3
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:14,156
Traffic badhao… requests line mein lagti hain, latency badhti hai, aur errors start!

4
00:00:17,105 --> 00:00:21,763
Easy fix? Aur servers add kar do! Load balancer sabko traffic distribute karega.

5
00:00:25,105 --> 00:00:30,971
Lekin ruk… database hi overload ho gaya! Sirf servers badhane se problem solve nahi hui.

6
00:00:33,109 --> 00:00:38,696
Ab cache enable karo. Repeated reads ka load kam hota hai, aur database ko breathing room milta hai!

7
00:00:41,111 --> 00:00:46,373
Autoscaling bhi lagao — traffic badhe toh new instances automatically ready ho sakein.

8
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:54,387
Capacity, caching aur queue ko balance karo… aur system recover kar sakta hai!

9
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:01,918
Best part? Ye scripted animation nahi. Har control ke peeche actual simulation logic hai!

10
00:01:03,073 --> 00:01:06,292
Tum apne server ko bacha paoge? Comment SERVER!
